:[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。投保时填一次，以后改受益人要书面通知保险公司。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["保险法规定，受益人由被保险人或者投保人指定。投保人指定的，要经被保险人同意。有三种情况，保险金算被保险人的遗产，按继承的规矩给。一是没指定受益人，或者指定得不清楚。二是受益人死在被保险人前面，又没有别的受益人。三是受益人依法丧失或者放弃受益权，又没有别的受益人。受益人和被保险人在同一件事里去世、分不清先后的，推定受益人先死。算作遗产的钱，要先清偿去世的人欠的税和债，剩下的才分。最高法的解释写明：受益人写成「姓名加身份关系」，出事时身份关系变了，算没指定受益人。改受益人没通知保险公司的，对保险公司不生效。领钱的诉讼时效，人寿保险是 5 年，其他保险是 2 年，都从知道或者应当知道出事那天算起。寿险保额通常在数十万元级，收益因此定为大（全国，2015 年修正、2021 年起）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2015 修正). 中华人民共和国保险法第二十六、三十九、四十一、四十二条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7c4060811","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7c4060811"]},"；最高人民法院 (2020 修正). 关于适用《中华人民共和国保险法》若干问题的解释（三）第九条第二款第三项、第十条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181799df4000179ac03d7f21115","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181799df4000179ac03d7f21115"]},"；全国人大 (2020). 中华人民共和国民法典第一千一百五十九条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["诉讼时效过了，保险公司可以拒绝给钱，打官司也很难要回来。所以家里人至少要知道你在哪几家公司买过保险。离婚、再婚、孩子出生以后，回头把受益人改一次。人走了以后逐个去取各处的钱，见第 25 节第 9 条（逐个去取）。用死还债这条路走不通，见第 29 节第 13 条（还债）。这条的受益人落在第 ② 档，是你的配偶和孩子。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/05-43"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"想退保就自己找保险公司办，别找「代理退保」，觉得被误导了打 12378 投诉"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/05-45"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别拿钱买比特币、泰达币这类虚拟货币，别人拉你一起投也不跟：交易不受法律保护，亏了打官司也要不回来"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-38"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["想买美股这类海外资产，走 QDII 基金或港股通，别去境外券商开户，也别拿每年的换汇额度去买"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["老虎、富途、长桥这类境外券商，2026 年 5 月起不许再给境内的人开户。已经开了的，两年内只能卖出、把钱转出来，不能再买。换汇额度也不许拿去买境外股票，违规的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-39"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["只给自己扛不住的损失买保险，扛得住的损失用应急金兜着"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["你交的保费不会全部赔回来，有一部分要付保险公司的费用和利润。所以值得买的，是很少发生、一旦发生家里掏不出来的损失，比如大病、开车撞伤人、家里挣钱的人走了。存款扛…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-40"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家里有人靠你的收入过日子，先给挣钱的人买定期寿险，别先给孩子买"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["定期寿险只保固定的年数，这些年里人走了，家里拿到一笔钱。它是给靠你收入过日子的家人留的，比如房贷没还完、孩子还小。没人靠你养，就用不着。孩子不挣钱，给孩子买的死…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-41"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["签了一年以上的人身险又后悔，在犹豫期内退掉，保费基本全退"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一年以上的人身险都有犹豫期。在银行买的，是收到保单后 15 天，这期间退保最多扣 10 元工本费。过了犹豫期再退，只能拿回保单里能退的那部分钱，往往比交的少。保…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-42"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["在银行柜台签字前，先看清手里的是存款还是保险"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["银行能代卖保险，但不许说成存款。保险合同的封面要用大字印「保险合同」和保险公司的名字，不许出现「存款」「储蓄」字样。封面上是保险公司，这钱就不是存款，过了犹豫期…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/05-46"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["没单位的人自己交职工养老保险，按最低档交、先把年限交够最划算；别当成一交就赚，按最低档也要领约 10 年才回本"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没单位的人自己交职工养老，按最低档交、把年限交够最划算。领的钱大头跟着退休那年当地的平均工资走。按那时的工资水平折算，最低档交 15 年、60 岁开始领，约领…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/05"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要浪费钱 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","